{"inkVersion":21,"root":[[{"->":"first_boat"},["done",{"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"first_boat":[["^第五日清晨，雾后露出黑崖，浪碎成白线。你趴在船边，肚里早已没有什么可吐，仍舍不得先抬头。 ","#","^beat:st_first_boat_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_approach ","/#","#","^cast:st_boatkeeper ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^你叫沈见潮，十二岁，白螺屿人。父亲捕鱼，母亲晒盐。第一次去归潮岛，船走五日，你吐了三日；崖顶楼没有旗，只悬望海二字。 ","#","^beat:st_first_boat_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_approach ","/#","#","^cast:st_boatkeeper ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^到了。海天门。 ","#","^beat:st_first_boat_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_approach ","/#","#","^cast:st_boatkeeper ","/#","#","^speaker:st_boatkeeper ","/#","#","^mood:st_boatkeeper=intent","/#","\n","^你想站起来，好让他知道自己不是只会吐的小孩。船却先摇了一下。 ","#","^beat:st_first_boat_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_approach ","/#","#","^cast:st_boatkeeper ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","ev","str","^先握栏，再顺船摇的方向站起，认清脚下才去看那座楼。 ","#","^cid:st_take_rail","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^先坐着等过这一波，再扶边站起，不为别人看你而抢这一下。 ","#","^cid:st_wait_wave","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_first_rail","re":true},"^手心沾了一点湿木屑。你站起时没比船快，反倒真看清黑崖上那两个字。 ","#","^beat:st_first_boat_5 ","/#","#","^scene:st_approach ","/#","#","^cast:st_boatkeeper ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^今日先别把早饭也送给望海楼。 ","#","^beat:st_first_boat_6 ","/#","#","^scene:st_approach ","/#","#","^cast:st_boatkeeper ","/#","#","^speaker:st_boatkeeper ","/#","#","^mood:st_boatkeeper=amused","/#","\n",{"->":"trial"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_first_rail","re":true},"^老人等你，没有替你向岸上喊勇敢。船身回落，你才把脚移到能踏住的地方。 ","#","^beat:st_first_boat_7 ","/#","#","^scene:st_approach ","/#","#","^cast:st_boatkeeper ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^我现在能看了。 ","#","^beat:st_first_boat_8 ","/#","#","^scene:st_approach ","/#","#","^cast:st_boatkeeper ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^楼又不走。 ","#","^beat:st_first_boat_9 ","/#","#","^scene:st_approach ","/#","#","^cast:st_boatkeeper ","/#","#","^speaker:st_boatkeeper ","/#","#","^mood:st_boatkeeper=amused","/#","\n",{"->":"trial"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"trial":[["^东极群岛更偏南、更深，大小四十余岛，常住的十余座。归潮岛有山、有田、三处大港；北面的蓬莱另是一大片门派岛寨，不能把你这一船算作罗天海当年登陆的那一港。 ","#","^beat:st_trial_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_trialshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator ","/#","#","^look:st_an=child","/#","\n","^三年一次试门，四十七个孩子排在水边。身旁阿岑也是白螺屿来的，先扯你袖口，问有没有看见他们叫人摆的木刀。 ","#","^beat:st_trial_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_trialshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^第一关，游水。 ","#","^beat:st_trial_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_trialshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:st_coach ","/#","#","^mood:st_coach=neutral","/#","\n","^不先打？ ","#","^beat:st_trial_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_trialshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:st_an ","/#","#","^mood:st_an=surprised","/#","\n","^你倒先游到那边，再问第二句。 ","#","^beat:st_trial_5 ","/#","#","^scene:st_trialshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:st_coach ","/#","#","^mood:st_coach=intent","/#","\n","ev","str","^按自己的气口游，不因阿岑先冲出去就跟着憋掉下一口。 ","#","^cid:st_swim_breath","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^沿教头指的回流外边走，先认水往哪去，再选自己能过的距离。 ","#","^cid:st_swim_line","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_trial_breath","re":true},"^你落后一截，转身时却还能换气。阿岑在前面呛了一口，听你呼气，终于也慢下来。 ","#","^beat:st_trial_6 ","/#","#","^scene:st_trialshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^教头让近处的人接着看，不叫十二岁的你在考场里冒充唯一能救人的大人。 ","#","^beat:st_trial_7 ","/#","#","^scene:st_trialshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"four_tests"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_trial_breath","re":true},"^你比阿岑绕得远，却没被回流带回去。他到岸时咳着问为什么，你指向刚才反复转白的水。 ","#","^beat:st_trial_8 ","/#","#","^scene:st_trialshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^认得一回，别当下回还在原处。 ","#","^beat:st_trial_9 ","/#","#","^scene:st_trialshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:st_coach ","/#","#","^mood:st_coach=intent","/#","\n",{"->":"four_tests"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"four_tests":[["^第二关攀崖，第三关认风。到第四关，才有人推你们三次，看谁少摔两跤。你仍摔得满手砂，抬起来，教头先看你指节还能不能动。 ","#","^beat:st_four_tests_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_trialshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^会打，可以慢慢学。海上先看你会不会活。 ","#","^beat:st_four_tests_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_trialshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:st_coach ","/#","#","^mood:st_coach=neutral","/#","\n","^四十七个孩子最后留下十六个，你和阿岑都在其中。没有人因游得快便免掉攀崖，也没人因最后站稳一次就不再学水。 ","#","^beat:st_four_tests_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_trialshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","ev","str","^收绳时请阿岑试解自己绑的一扣，练会让接手的人也能用。 ","#","^cid:st_learn_shared_knot","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^先练自己湿手也能快收快放的一扣，把慢处一遍遍重做。 ","#","^cid:st_learn_fast_knot","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_shared_knot","re":true},"^他扯半晌解不开，你只得重新绑。省下自己半口夸奖，换来两个人都记得怎样在湿绳里松开这一扣。 ","#","^beat:st_four_tests_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_trialshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^别怪我手笨。你下回掉水里，绳也不能只认你的手。 ","#","^beat:st_four_tests_5 ","/#","#","^scene:st_trialshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:st_an ","/#","#","^mood:st_an=amused","/#","\n",{"->":"outer_years"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_shared_knot","re":true},"^你的手很快，教头却仍叫你递给别人。阿岑解不开，你先替他解了，催着再练；这一回省下时辰，却没真让下一只手学会。 ","#","^beat:st_four_tests_6 ","/#","#","^scene:st_trialshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^你不在，我再问谁？ ","#","^beat:st_four_tests_7 ","/#","#","^scene:st_trialshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:st_an ","/#","#","^mood:st_an=uneasy","/#","\n","^你说以后教，转身又拿起木刀。 ","#","^beat:st_four_tests_8 ","/#","#","^scene:st_trialshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"outer_years"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"outer_years":[["^外院六年，海潮拳、短刀、步法、基础吐纳，也学掌船、绑绳、识潮、修帆、救溺。十七岁的你把断帆补好，终于忍不住问，这些哪里像武功。 ","#","^beat:st_outer_years_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_outeryard ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator ","/#","#","^look:st_an=youth ","/#","#","^cg:rigging ","/#","#","^action:绳与帆","/#","\n","^我今日绑绳比你快，算不算赢？ ","#","^beat:st_outer_years_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_outeryard ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:st_an ","/#","#","^mood:st_an=amused","/#","\n","^我问的是正经的。 ","#","^beat:st_outer_years_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_outeryard ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:you ","/#","#","^cg:none","/#","\n","^你若在海上把人打赢，船却沉了，算谁赢？ ","#","^beat:st_outer_years_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_outeryard ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach ","/#","#","^speaker:st_coach ","/#","#","^mood:st_coach=intent ","/#","#","^camera:portrait ","/#","#","^action:外院教头 · 算谁赢","/#","\n","^你手里还拿针，半天才把没说完的那句吞回去。 ","#","^beat:st_outer_years_5 ","/#","#","^scene:st_outeryard ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"st_shared_knot"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^早年你肯同阿岑互解一扣，这几年忙起来，却也常由最快的人一把做完。教头这回的问，把那项已经会过却没一直做的事又放回眼前。 ","#","^beat:st_outer_years_6 ","/#","#","^scene:st_outeryard ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.96"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^早年你说以后教的一扣，后来终于教过了，不再只是自己会。可是每换一个新人，仍得从头让他试；会过一次，并不等于每一班都真接得住。 ","#","^beat:st_outer_years_7 ","/#","#","^scene:st_outeryard ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.96"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^以后收工留一轮换手，让别人解绳、自己来接，不总由最快的人做完。 ","#","^cid:st_practice_exchange","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^以后把自己的湿手解扣练得更熟，另找时辰问接手的办法。 ","#","^cid:st_practice_alone","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_exchange_drill","re":true},"^阿岑真把绳递回来，你才发现他留的扣与你习惯不同。你们晚走了一刻，饭已经温了，教头没替你们把那一刻变成一招能赢人的绝学。 ","#","^beat:st_outer_years_8 ","/#","#","^scene:st_outeryard ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"tide_step"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_exchange_drill","re":true},"^你一人练到绳股磨热，收放确实更快。别人来接时，你仍惯于自己抢回来做完。那句以后问没有消失，只是被每天最急的活挤到后头。 ","#","^beat:st_outer_years_9 ","/#","#","^scene:st_outeryard ","/#","#","^cast:st_coach,st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"tide_step"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"tide_step":[["^十八岁过潮试，入正传。刀、掌、棍、长兵器开始分路，人人却都学潮行。老师把你带到小船上，只说站稳。 ","#","^beat:st_tide_step_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_smallboat ","/#","#","^cast:st_tidemaster ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^你才站好，他一脚踹船舷，你便落水。连续七日，你终于能在晃船上纹丝不动，刚要抬头看他。 ","#","^beat:st_tide_step_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_smallboat ","/#","#","^cast:st_tidemaster ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^错了。 ","#","^beat:st_tide_step_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_smallboat ","/#","#","^cast:st_tidemaster ","/#","#","^speaker:st_tidemaster ","/#","#","^mood:st_tidemaster=intent","/#","\n","^还不够稳？ ","#","^beat:st_tide_step_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_smallboat ","/#","#","^cast:st_tidemaster ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^船本来在动。下一步呢？ ","#","^beat:st_tide_step_5 ","/#","#","^scene:st_smallboat ","/#","#","^cast:st_tidemaster ","/#","#","^speaker:st_tidemaster ","/#","#","^mood:st_tidemaster=neutral","/#","\n","ev","str","^松开死顶的膝，试着让船带动自己，再从这一下迈出去。 ","#","^cid:st_follow_motion","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^不再求七日练成的姿势，先退让半步，看不稳以后还有哪里能落脚。 ","#","^cid:st_release_fixed","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_tide_follow","re":true},"^你又跌一次，这次却知道自己何时还能转脚。老师没伸手把你摆成一个永远正确的架子，只等你从水里爬回。 ","#","^beat:st_tide_step_6 ","/#","#","^scene:st_smallboat ","/#","#","^cast:st_tidemaster ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^刚才还能走，是我不肯松。 ","#","^beat:st_tide_step_7 ","/#","#","^scene:st_smallboat ","/#","#","^cast:st_tidemaster ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^那再来。 ","#","^beat:st_tide_step_8 ","/#","#","^scene:st_smallboat ","/#","#","^cast:st_tidemaster ","/#","#","^speaker:st_tidemaster ","/#","#","^mood:st_tidemaster=neutral","/#","\n",{"->":"eleven_years"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_tide_follow","re":true},"^一退，船头又翘起来，你只得把刚找的地方也放掉。第二步落下时，老师才点头。 ","#","^beat:st_tide_step_9 ","/#","#","^scene:st_smallboat ","/#","#","^cast:st_tidemaster ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^不是永远稳，是不稳时还能走。 ","#","^beat:st_tide_step_10 ","/#","#","^scene:st_smallboat ","/#","#","^cast:st_tidemaster ","/#","#","^speaker:st_tidemaster ","/#","#","^mood:st_tidemaster=neutral","/#","\n","^你喘着气，把船沿上的水抹掉，给下一次留了位置。 ","#","^beat:st_tide_step_11 ","/#","#","^scene:st_smallboat ","/#","#","^cast:st_tidemaster ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"eleven_years"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"eleven_years":["^随后十一年，练武也跟船，潮行不是会背这两句话就不再落水。你与阿岑从候潮的小孩长到能在船上接班的大人，饭桌上已经有人问下次工钱何时结。 ","#","^beat:st_eleven_years_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_workshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator ","/#","#","^look:st_an=adult","/#","\n","^明早外海船回来，先接缆再查帆。你别一上船又只问有没有高手。 ","#","^beat:st_eleven_years_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_workshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:st_an ","/#","#","^mood:st_an=intent","/#","\n","^我若问，你叫我先把绳交了。 ","#","^beat:st_eleven_years_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_workshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^你说着，把明日用的绳移到两人都能摸到的地方。二十九岁那年，东极的大风先到了。 ","#","^beat:st_eleven_years_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_workshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"storm"},null],"storm":[["^十一艘商船里，三艘撞礁。你跟门里赶到时，一艘船正向另一侧倾，船上还有二十余人没转出来。阿岑在接应船头，船主指着那根已裂开的桅，话被风吞了一半。 ","#","^beat:st_storm_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_storm ","/#","#","^cast:st_an,st_shipper ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^还有孩子，躲在那边！ ","#","^beat:st_storm_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_storm ","/#","#","^cast:st_an,st_shipper ","/#","#","^speaker:st_shipper ","/#","#","^mood:st_shipper=uneasy","/#","\n","^我接这头。你说先过人，还是先把两船牵住！ ","#","^beat:st_storm_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_storm ","/#","#","^cast:st_an,st_shipper ","/#","#","^speaker:st_an ","/#","#","^mood:st_an=sharp","/#","\n","^你看见船距又张开。这里没有等你打赢便会停下的敌人，只有一船来不及等下一次商量的人。 ","#","^beat:st_storm_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_storm ","/#","#","^cast:st_an,st_shipper ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","ev","str","^先请阿岑牵住转人这一线，自己准备跨过去，分明谁接哪一头。 ","#","^cid:st_set_transfer_line","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^先让眼前能动的人转过去，自己准备去够住滞在远边的人。 ","#","^cid:st_send_nearest_people","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_transfer_line","re":true},"^你守这根，不随我跳。过来一个，先送进去，别堵船头！ ","#","^beat:st_storm_5 ","/#","#","^scene:st_storm ","/#","#","^cast:st_an,st_shipper ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^阿岑叫近旁两人接位，自己把绳压到能再松的地方。你刚看见两船靠近，便抢着向那条将沉的船跃去。 ","#","^beat:st_storm_6 ","/#","#","^scene:st_storm ","/#","#","^cast:st_an,st_shipper ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"broken_mast"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_transfer_line","re":true},"^先接这几个人。我去远头，别叫他们跟我挤在一边！ ","#","^beat:st_storm_7 ","/#","#","^scene:st_storm ","/#","#","^cast:st_an,st_shipper ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^阿岑把近处的人接走，转人确实开始了；空出的这一刻，你却把该再认一次的裂桅漏在身后，抢着跃过去。 ","#","^beat:st_storm_8 ","/#","#","^scene:st_storm ","/#","#","^cast:st_an,st_shipper ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"broken_mast"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"broken_mast":[["^你太急。落脚还没来得及换，断桅已倒下，木梁把你压在船边。胸口贴着湿船板，一只手够不着近处，另一只手也推不起那根梁。 ","#","^beat:st_broken_mast_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_mast ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^见潮！别再往水里挣！ ","#","^beat:st_broken_mast_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_mast ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:st_an ","/#","#","^mood:st_an=sharp","/#","\n","^你本想过去接人，此刻反成一处还得别人来接的险。 ","#","^beat:st_broken_mast_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_mast ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"st_exchange_drill"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^这些年你们收工总肯多换一轮手。阿岑把你常用的一扣交给旁人，对方能解，绳便真松出一段接住退回的人。他自己留下牵住你这边，没有把整条绳缠上手臂。 ","#","^beat:st_broken_mast_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_mast ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.47"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^阿岑知道你会解这一扣，却没替下一只手练会。接位的人一扯不开，他只得自己回身松绳，再来牵你这边；急里把绳压在腕上，绳股抽过去，痛得他咬紧牙仍不敢撒手。 ","#","^beat:st_broken_mast_5 ","/#","#","^scene:st_mast ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.47"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^朝阿岑叫清自己被压的位置，别让他也跳进同一处险。 ","#","^cid:st_call_clear_gap","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^先指给接应者孩子躲的地方，把自己的慌分出一句能用的话。 ","#","^cid:st_show_child_place","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_call_gap","re":true},"^梁压住我。你别来，留在能接人的那边！ ","#","^beat:st_broken_mast_6 ","/#","#","^scene:st_mast ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^你喘不过一整句，便分成两次喊。那头终于不再往你这里跳，船边多留下一个还能抬手接人的人。 ","#","^beat:st_broken_mast_7 ","/#","#","^scene:st_mast ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"three_steps"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_call_gap","re":true},"^你手抬不起，只能用眼与下颌示向那边。阿岑看明白，朝后来的人转喊；你喊到最后没了声，也没能凭想救人便忽然推开木梁。 ","#","^beat:st_broken_mast_8 ","/#","#","^scene:st_mast ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"three_steps"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"three_steps":[["^有人从另一条船跃来，在倾斜桅杆上走三步，如走平地。第一掌拍断压你的梁，继而越过你，把旁边吓得不会动的孩子送出。 ","#","^beat:st_three_steps_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_mast ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^你被接回时，回头仍看见他往里走。最后一个离船的人，也是他。 ","#","^beat:st_three_steps_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_mast ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^那是你第一次真正见叶孤舟，内院第六席。你还没叫出谢字，他已先问接应船能不能再腾一处，不肯站在你面前等你把救命的道理说完。 ","#","^beat:st_three_steps_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_mast ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","ev","str","^缓过一口气便在接应船帮抬，不再跳回自己刚逃出的险处证明勇敢。 ","#","^cid:st_take_next_carry","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^先把船头接下的人送开，叫后来的人有地方落，不再挤在叶孤舟身旁。 ","#","^cid:st_clear_landing","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_after_carry","re":true},"^腿仍抖，你就蹲着接递来的手。你没有成为最后离船的人，只把眼前能送到舱内的这一位真送过去。 ","#","^beat:st_three_steps_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_mast ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^这里接住，别把刚腾开的路又挡了。 ","#","^beat:st_three_steps_5 ","/#","#","^scene:st_mast ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=intent","/#","\n",{"->":"after_storm"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_after_carry","re":true},"^你扶一个人往里退，近处的人才跟着让路。风里那道能落脚的空处，比你再喊一遍我能跳更有用。 ","#","^beat:st_three_steps_6 ","/#","#","^scene:st_mast ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^对，再退一个位置。 ","#","^beat:st_three_steps_7 ","/#","#","^scene:st_mast ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=intent","/#","\n",{"->":"after_storm"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"after_storm":[["^大风过去，不会因为你获救就自动把各家船修好。阿岑要回白螺屿告诉家里这回怎么了，你陪他等工钱，也看他能不能独自把湿袖捋上去。 ","#","^beat:st_after_storm_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_workshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"st_exchange_drill"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^他的手没被那回接绳抽伤，隔几日便能照常做活。你们把换手那一轮教给这次接位的人，来回多练两晚，没把一次接对说成永远不会再乱。 ","#","^beat:st_after_storm_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_workshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^别再一学会就全抢回去。你在下面压着的时候，绳也没空等你。 ","#","^beat:st_after_storm_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_workshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:st_an ","/#","#","^mood:st_an=amused","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.16"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^他腕上的伤养了两个月，重活做不得，少了两趟船钱。你接他能让出的班，自己少练了几个夜里；替班的钱有了，痛和错过的船并没被一句对不起抹掉。 ","#","^beat:st_after_storm_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_workshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^先替我这一趟。等我好了，教会我再走，别下回还只有你会。 ","#","^beat:st_after_storm_5 ","/#","#","^scene:st_workshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:st_an ","/#","#","^mood:st_an=intent","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.16"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^向来问话的叶孤舟说清自己漏看断桅，不用救人的本意遮过去。 ","#","^cid:st_admit_rush","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^把落脚到被压的一段重走给叶孤舟看，找出自己何处已没有下一步。 ","#","^cid:st_trace_next_step","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_rush_plain","re":true},"^我看见要去的人，却没再看脚下会断的地方。 ","#","^beat:st_after_storm_6 ","/#","#","^scene:st_workshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^他说知道，没再逼你把懊悔说得更响。下一回之前，他叫你先能把接应的那个人也讲清楚。 ","#","^beat:st_after_storm_7 ","/#","#","^scene:st_workshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"inner_court"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_rush_plain","re":true},"^你在岸上走到那一步，脚便停住。没有风，仍能看见自己当时只盯着要到的地方。 ","#","^beat:st_after_storm_8 ","/#","#","^scene:st_workshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^我想过去，没有想过去以后怎么回。 ","#","^beat:st_after_storm_9 ","/#","#","^scene:st_workshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^他让你把这一段重新走完。 ","#","^beat:st_after_storm_10 ","/#","#","^scene:st_workshore ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"inner_court"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"inner_court":[["^半年后，你因那次救船调入内院，已近三十。叶孤舟问，若再来一次，还跳不跳。 ","#","^beat:st_inner_court_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^跳。但不会那样跳了。 ","#","^beat:st_inner_court_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^这才值得教。 ","#","^beat:st_inner_court_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=amused","/#","\n","^内院人少，得能独当一面。其上九席，门主统摄全门；退位门主、前代高席和百岁仍留岛的老人，多住镇海院。你听见九席，最先想的仍是谁更能打。 ","#","^beat:st_inner_court_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","ev","str","^直接问第四与第六到底相当于中原第几，不假装自己已经懂。 ","#","^cid:st_ask_rank","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^先问为什么同一人上岸与上船不同，试着从那三步里找自己的问题。 ","#","^cid:st_ask_ground","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_rank_question","re":true},"^叶观澜师兄第四，您第六，放中原算第几？ ","#","^beat:st_inner_court_5 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^你等见过我们在哪儿做什么，再来问同一句。 ","#","^beat:st_inner_court_6 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=amused","/#","\n",{"->":"four_six"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_rank_question","re":true},"^若换成平地，那三步还能这样走？ ","#","^beat:st_inner_court_7 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^平地又没有那根桅。你先去看观澜的脚，别拿我这一下替所有地方作数。 ","#","^beat:st_inner_court_8 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=intent","/#","\n",{"->":"four_six"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"four_six":[["^叶观澜列第四，叶孤舟第六，两人都未入化。平整青石坪上，观澜正面更强；换夜海、风浪、接舷两船，孤舟更会借潮与乱局，结果便可能反过来。 ","#","^beat:st_four_six_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_court ","/#","#","^cast:st_guanlan,st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^你站我正前，不必替孤舟先藏一处船舷。 ","#","^beat:st_four_six_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_court ","/#","#","^cast:st_guanlan,st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:st_guanlan ","/#","#","^mood:st_guanlan=intent","/#","\n","^他进一步，你才要照船上那样让，脚下没有会下沉的船，掌已从肩前逼来。叶孤舟没替你把这回解释成海上必能赢。 ","#","^beat:st_four_six_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_court ","/#","#","^cast:st_guanlan,st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^你先接完今天这一手。 ","#","^beat:st_four_six_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_court ","/#","#","^cast:st_guanlan,st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=amused","/#","\n","ev","str","^留在平地把刚才没接住的一步试完，不急着拿海上替自己找回场。 ","#","^cid:st_test_flat_step","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^请两位各走一次同一来招，自己站进去接，看区别而非背一句各有长短。 ","#","^cid:st_compare_live_step","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_flat_practice","re":true},"^观澜又进，你放掉预想里那阵浪，才在真实石面上找到还能退转的一点。 ","#","^beat:st_four_six_5 ","/#","#","^scene:st_court ","/#","#","^cast:st_guanlan,st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^这回脚在这里。下回再认。 ","#","^beat:st_four_six_6 ","/#","#","^scene:st_court ","/#","#","^cast:st_guanlan,st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:st_guanlan ","/#","#","^mood:st_guanlan=neutral","/#","\n",{"->":"report_from_mainland"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_flat_practice","re":true},"^同一来掌，两人续法不同。你接孤舟的手也没自动变容易，他在平地仍比你深得多；你不能因说清相对强弱就凭空省去这些年的工夫。 ","#","^beat:st_four_six_7 ","/#","#","^scene:st_court ","/#","#","^cast:st_guanlan,st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"report_from_mainland"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"report_from_mainland":["^后来中原传回龙虎风云会的战报：叶观澜与北榜第十四郭洪，一百零六合互有杀着，主事同时叫停。这是你在岛上听来的，不是你忽然站到中原场边亲见的一战。 ","#","^beat:st_report_from_mainland_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_oldtutor ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^那他们大概是中段到中前段？ ","#","^beat:st_report_from_mainland_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_oldtutor ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^大约。然后呢？ ","#","^beat:st_report_from_mainland_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_oldtutor ","/#","#","^speaker:st_oldtutor ","/#","#","^mood:st_oldtutor=neutral","/#","\n","^没有然后？ ","#","^beat:st_report_from_mainland_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_oldtutor ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^换个人、换地方、换一年，都要变。 ","#","^beat:st_report_from_mainland_5 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_oldtutor ","/#","#","^speaker:st_oldtutor ","/#","#","^mood:st_oldtutor=intent","/#","\n","^你还想问怎样把这句话换成一张总不会改的座次。直到四十多岁，叶孤舟自外海归来，去找第一席谢观海。 ","#","^beat:st_report_from_mainland_6 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_oldtutor ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"borrow_hand"},null],"borrow_hand":[["^谢观海九十余，入化多年，仍占第一席，住处却不在镇海院：门里有些事，还需要他看。叶孤舟刚在外海追船连胜两位成名海客，岛上都说六席又深了。 ","#","^beat:st_borrow_hand_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_xie ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^谢师兄，借我一手。 ","#","^beat:st_borrow_hand_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_xie ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=intent","/#","\n","^几手？ ","#","^beat:st_borrow_hand_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_xie ","/#","#","^speaker:st_xie ","/#","#","^mood:st_xie=neutral","/#","\n","^打到您觉得够。 ","#","^beat:st_borrow_hand_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_xie ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=neutral","/#","\n","^谢放下茶碗，不拿兵器。你四十多，自认已看得懂，这一回先看叶孤舟怎样进。 ","#","^beat:st_borrow_hand_5 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_xie ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","ev","str","^不只盯棍尖，看看叶每次进以后，还剩哪里能走。 ","#","^cid:st_watch_next_space","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^先看叶孤舟每一招自己想做什么，不拿第一席名头提前替他认输。 ","#","^cid:st_watch_own_choice","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_watch_space","re":true},"^第一招叶进，谢侧一步。那一步不是退远，却叫叶原可接上的一处挤在两人身后；你眼睛跟过去，才发现棍还得从别处回来。 ","#","^beat:st_borrow_hand_6 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_xie ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"two_hands"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_watch_space","re":true},"^第一招叶进，谢侧一步。叶步没乱，棍也快，你几乎想替他说这一步走得对；可眼前两人的位置已经和你那句对不一样。 ","#","^beat:st_borrow_hand_7 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_xie ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"two_hands"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"two_hands":[["^第二招，短棍封住中线。谢在棍侧轻碰，第三招后你才渐觉不对。每一手单看似乎没错，叶每作一个选择，下一步能走的地方却少一块。 ","#","^beat:st_two_hands_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_xie ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^第五招，叶第一次后退。第七招，短棍被带偏。第九招，谢的右手停在叶胸前，棍仍在外侧。 ","#","^beat:st_two_hands_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_xie ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^还来么？ ","#","^beat:st_two_hands_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_xie ","/#","#","^speaker:st_xie ","/#","#","^mood:st_xie=neutral","/#","\n","^不用了。 ","#","^beat:st_two_hands_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_xie ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=intent","/#","\n","^谢坐回去喝茶，呼吸没变多少。你站了半天，还想从别处找一句能把九手解释轻的话。 ","#","^beat:st_two_hands_5 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_xie ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","ev","str","^问他是不是那日状态不好，听他亲口说这并不是理由。 ","#","^cid:st_ask_condition","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^问同一手为什么自己看着对、下一步却已经少了路。 ","#","^cid:st_ask_earlier","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_condition_excuse","re":true},"^您是不是状态不好？ ","#","^beat:st_two_hands_6 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_xie ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^我状态很好。 ","#","^beat:st_two_hands_7 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_xie ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=intent","/#","\n","^那九招…… ","#","^beat:st_two_hands_8 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_xie ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^九招够了。 ","#","^beat:st_two_hands_9 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_xie ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=neutral","/#","\n","^他没替你保一个第六席本该再打百招的愿望。 ","#","^beat:st_two_hands_10 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_xie ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"nine_enough"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_condition_excuse","re":true},"^你每一手都知道自己在做什么，为什么还会那样？ ","#","^beat:st_two_hands_11 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_xie ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^他比我早知道。 ","#","^beat:st_two_hands_12 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_xie ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=intent","/#","\n","^你回想第二招那一碰，才知道自己看懂这招想做什么，不等于已看见对方将把下一步放到哪里。 ","#","^beat:st_two_hands_13 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_xie ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"nine_enough"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"nine_enough":[["^我每一招都知道自己在做什么。他比我早知道。 ","#","^beat:st_nine_enough_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=neutral","/#","\n","^你第一次真正看见入化与未入化之间这段差距。不是每个未入化都一样：门外仍有韩世雄那样能叫入化人物费力的异数；叶与观澜已很深，却还没到门口最窄的地方。 ","#","^beat:st_nine_enough_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^你还没有因看懂一句话便入化。几年以后，自己的脾气仍比认输的道理先来。 ","#","^beat:st_nine_enough_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","ev","str","^往后巡船先同接班的人试一遍位置，把自己看到的险说明白。 ","#","^cid:st_prepare_shared_post","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^往后巡船先把最难的一段自己练熟，再把余处交别人，不让慢手挡住眼前的急。 ","#","^cid:st_prepare_fast_post","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_shared_post","re":true},"^这会多占出港前半刻。有人嫌慢，你让他真从另一头接，自己也从那一头走回；直到不靠你喊第二遍也能松开这条路。 ","#","^beat:st_nine_enough_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"seven_ships"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_shared_post","re":true},"^你做得快，其他人也习惯等你做完。你以为最险的归自己就是负责，至于自己被另一处叫走以后谁接，常留到真起风才再说。 ","#","^beat:st_nine_enough_5 ","/#","#","^scene:st_teacourt ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"seven_ships"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"seven_ships":[["^四十七岁那场大风，你带回七条船，周望海九条。这两个数不会因为你怎样安排七条便多长出两条。回港时，自己的第七船仍在等岸上接下一段。 ","#","^beat:st_seven_ships_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_returnport ","/#","#","^cast:st_zhou,st_deckhand ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^谁带病客进去，谁还看缆？你先说，我跟着。 ","#","^beat:st_seven_ships_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_returnport ","/#","#","^cast:st_zhou,st_deckhand ","/#","#","^speaker:st_deckhand ","/#","#","^mood:st_deckhand=uneasy","/#","\n","^周的船也陆续靠岸，他不站在你船头等人报谁更多。 ","#","^beat:st_seven_ships_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_returnport ","/#","#","^cast:st_zhou,st_deckhand ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"st_shared_post"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^接班的人出港前试过两头，病客转入以后还有人照看缆。你留在第七船到交清才走，错过了当晚原约的问手；第二日人能照常接班，没再把你从住处喊回来。 ","#","^beat:st_seven_ships_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_returnport ","/#","#","^cast:st_zhou,st_deckhand ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^这头我来。你说过的那一步，我自己走过。 ","#","^beat:st_seven_ships_5 ","/#","#","^scene:st_returnport ","/#","#","^cast:st_zhou,st_deckhand ","/#","#","^speaker:st_deckhand ","/#","#","^mood:st_deckhand=intent","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.47"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^你先把病客送进，绳那头的人却等着你；等你回身，岸上接位又空一处。船都带回了，你仍得守到次日补交，船工也跟着多候一夜，第二日少接一份短工。 ","#","^beat:st_seven_ships_6 ","/#","#","^scene:st_returnport ","/#","#","^cast:st_zhou,st_deckhand ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^我不是不肯接。你刚才走前，没说我能不能松。 ","#","^beat:st_seven_ships_7 ","/#","#","^scene:st_returnport ","/#","#","^cast:st_zhou,st_deckhand ","/#","#","^speaker:st_deckhand ","/#","#","^mood:st_deckhand=uneasy","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.47"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^先把候夜与替班工钱说清，自己该误的约自己去解释。 ","#","^cid:st_pay_waiting","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^先请船工把自己离开后的那段走一次，再补该付的候夜，不只叫他下次机灵。 ","#","^cid:st_rehearse_handoff","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_wait_paid","re":true},"^你把差的那份记在自己这边，次日去道歉，不拿带回七船作别人都该再等你的理由。 ","#","^beat:st_seven_ships_8 ","/#","#","^scene:st_returnport ","/#","#","^cast:st_zhou,st_deckhand ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^他们得知道下次有人接，才敢先进去抬人。 ","#","^beat:st_seven_ships_9 ","/#","#","^scene:st_returnport ","/#","#","^cast:st_zhou,st_deckhand ","/#","#","^speaker:st_zhou ","/#","#","^mood:st_zhou=intent","/#","\n",{"->":"ninth_empty"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_wait_paid","re":true},"^他从缆这头走到门边，你才看见两处根本不能同时站。你给另一处补了人，也补该付的工钱，不能用一遍改法把昨天多候的一夜取消。 ","#","^beat:st_seven_ships_10 ","/#","#","^scene:st_returnport ","/#","#","^cast:st_zhou,st_deckhand ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^这回谁接，说给他本人听。 ","#","^beat:st_seven_ships_11 ","/#","#","^scene:st_returnport ","/#","#","^cast:st_zhou,st_deckhand ","/#","#","^speaker:st_zhou ","/#","#","^mood:st_zhou=neutral","/#","\n",{"->":"ninth_empty"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"ninth_empty":[["^四十九岁，第九席空缺，候选五人。论单打，你自认第二；定下来的却是周望海。你赢过他，这件事一点也没替你把那张椅子挪近。 ","#","^beat:st_ninth_empty_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_zhou ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^你气了三个月没和他说话。周来取巡船差，你把该交的仍交，话却短得像每个字都要多付钱。三个月后，你终于去问叶孤舟。 ","#","^beat:st_ninth_empty_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_zhou ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^我明明赢过他，为什么不是我？ ","#","^beat:st_ninth_empty_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_zhou ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^白沙屿两帮械斗，你怎么处理的？ ","#","^beat:st_ninth_empty_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_zhou ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=intent","/#","\n","^打服。 ","#","^beat:st_ninth_empty_5 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_zhou ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^三个月后是不是又打了一次？ ","#","^beat:st_ninth_empty_6 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_zhou ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=neutral","/#","\n","^你不说话。 ","#","^beat:st_ninth_empty_7 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_zhou ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","ev","str","^让他把周去过以后的事说完，不再把自己赢过周那一场插进去。 ","#","^cid:st_listen_seven_years","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^问自己打完以后漏下什么，不只问周有没有向别人求助。 ","#","^cid:st_ask_missing_work","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_listen_seat","re":true},"^周后来去一趟，两边七年没再动。 ","#","^beat:st_ninth_empty_8 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_zhou ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=neutral","/#","\n","^这七年不是周单打比你多赢的七场，是后来真没人再被两帮喊去打。你那次打服的声势，没替三个月以后多留住一天。 ","#","^beat:st_ninth_empty_9 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_zhou ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"better_seat"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_listen_seat","re":true},"^他后来把什么留在那里了？ ","#","^beat:st_ninth_empty_10 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_zhou ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^先把两边后来七年没再动这件事听进去。你打完，三个月又打了。 ","#","^beat:st_ninth_empty_11 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_zhou ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=neutral","/#","\n","^你想从周的办法里拣一句可以马上学会的，叶却没让你省掉看那七年的耐心。 ","#","^beat:st_ninth_empty_12 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_zhou ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"better_seat"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"better_seat":[["^前年大风，你带回来几条船？ ","#","^beat:st_better_seat_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=neutral","/#","\n","^七条。 ","#","^beat:st_better_seat_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^周望海九条。你比他会打。他那几年，比你更适合坐那个位置。 ","#","^beat:st_better_seat_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=neutral","/#","\n","^你不再有话，并不等于第二日见周就忽然心里全无不平。九席大体前位更重，却有传功、巡海、外务、守岛；不能哪天胜过第八，便自动升第八。 ","#","^beat:st_better_seat_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","ev","str","^先向周把三个月没肯说完的话补上，不求他先夸自己大度。 ","#","^cid:st_repair_talk","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^先随周去看白沙屿如何过今天，不把赔一句话当已补上漏掉的活。 ","#","^cid:st_repair_work","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_zhou_talk","re":true},"^你交过来的差，我接。但下回你说谁接哪一头，我会听完。 ","#","^beat:st_better_seat_5 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^周把当日去处讲清，没拿这份难得的开口换一声早就该懂了。 ","#","^beat:st_better_seat_6 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^那先去看他们明早怎么出港。不是去听我讲自己做得好。 ","#","^beat:st_better_seat_7 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_zhou,st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:st_zhou ","/#","#","^mood:st_zhou=intent","/#","\n",{"->":"fourteen_years"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_zhou_talk","re":true},"^你到白沙屿，没让两边再摆一场拳。今日争的是谁先用修船地，你得听他们把能过明日的办法说完。 ","#","^beat:st_better_seat_8 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_zhou,st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^回程你向周认自己三个月话难听，他没免你这句，也没叫你把每件事都当面认输给他。 ","#","^beat:st_better_seat_9 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_zhou,st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^明日我有别处。你来接这里。 ","#","^beat:st_better_seat_10 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_zhou,st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:st_zhou ","/#","#","^mood:st_zhou=neutral","/#","\n",{"->":"fourteen_years"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"fourteen_years":[["^从四十九到六十三，十四年不是一句想通便跳过的空白。白沙屿两帮七年未动早是周留下的结果，你后来去，不抢作自己的功；本门还得年年巡海、教人、护住旧差旁生的新事。 ","#","^beat:st_fourteen_years_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_returnport ","/#","#","^cast:st_zhou ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^今日哪处你来？不是再比七与九。 ","#","^beat:st_fourteen_years_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_returnport ","/#","#","^cast:st_zhou ","/#","#","^speaker:st_zhou ","/#","#","^mood:st_zhou=intent","/#","\n","^你望一眼教场，又看一眼正候潮的船。两边都有人缺，你得真选一边，再把另一边交给肯接的人。 ","#","^beat:st_fourteen_years_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_returnport ","/#","#","^cast:st_zhou ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","ev","str","^长些日子留在教场，把潮行和接位教给后来的人，远海交给同门。 ","#","^cid:st_life_teach","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^长些日子留在巡海线上，带新人认港认人，教场托给同门。 ","#","^cid:st_life_patrol","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",1,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_life","re":true},"^你少跑几条自己仍想去的远线，先把早课与晚归的人分开接。周替你接远港，你替他带回来的新人多留一课，谁也没凭一张排班就同时在两地。 ","#","^beat:st_fourteen_years_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_returnport ","/#","#","^cast:st_zhou ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"sixty_three"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",2,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_life","re":true},"^你少亲看几班刚学会的弟子，把课交给同门，再带新人上船。周问你谁接下一港，你回去真找本人说清，不把岸上的人当一声托付就永远有空。 ","#","^beat:st_fourteen_years_5 ","/#","#","^scene:st_returnport ","/#","#","^cast:st_zhou ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"sixty_three"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"sixty_three":[["^六十三，你终于补入第九席。这回你没有先问能不能再打第八。门里出了大事，自己负责的那一块不能塌，才是这一席每天真要坐住的地方。 ","#","^beat:st_sixty_three_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator ","/#","#","^look:st_ye=late","/#","\n","^跟我走。镇海院。 ","#","^beat:st_sixty_three_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=intent","/#","\n","^今日？ ","#","^beat:st_sixty_three_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^你还要准备一张问手名单带进去？ ","#","^beat:st_sixty_three_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=amused","/#","\n","^你下意识摸了一下衣襟，才笑。四十余岁看过的九招此刻又回到眼前，并不是到六十三岁才第一次看见。 ","#","^beat:st_sixty_three_5 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","ev","str","^把先想好的名次放在门外，跟他去看住在那里的人。 ","#","^cid:st_enter_light","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^问院里的人如今还做什么，带着能听见答复的问题进去。 ","#","^cid:st_ask_duty_here","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_enter_plain","re":true},"^东崖后的路不设擂台，也没有一行固定椅子等你对号。你走到院口，先闻见晒鱼的咸味。 ","#","^beat:st_sixty_three_6 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"dry_fish"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_enter_plain","re":true},"^先看。别认得一张旧总谱就替每个人把今天安排好了。 ","#","^beat:st_sixty_three_7 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=neutral","/#","\n","^门内有人拨鱼，你听见竹匾轻响，忽然觉得自己预备问的一长串还不如这一下近。 ","#","^beat:st_sixty_three_8 ","/#","#","^scene:st_inner ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"dry_fish"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"dry_fish":[["^一个百余岁的老人蹲在院里晒鱼。叶孤舟叫师叔祖，他抬头看你。 ","#","^beat:st_dry_fish_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_oldyard ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_fishelder ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^新九席？ ","#","^beat:st_dry_fish_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_oldyard ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_fishelder ","/#","#","^speaker:st_fishelder ","/#","#","^mood:st_fishelder=neutral","/#","\n","^是。第九。 ","#","^beat:st_dry_fish_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_oldyard ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_fishelder ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^这么年轻？ ","#","^beat:st_dry_fish_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_oldyard ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_fishelder ","/#","#","^speaker:st_fishelder ","/#","#","^mood:st_fishelder=amused","/#","\n","^你六十三，头回听人这样说。他叫你打一手，你刚摆架，胸口已被一根手指点住。没等你换完，老人转身继续拨鱼。 ","#","^beat:st_dry_fish_5 ","/#","#","^scene:st_oldyard ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_fishelder ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^还行。 ","#","^beat:st_dry_fish_6 ","/#","#","^scene:st_oldyard ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_fishelder ","/#","#","^speaker:st_fishelder ","/#","#","^mood:st_fishelder=neutral","/#","\n","ev","str","^问刚才自己哪里先被看见，不要老人为一声还行再打一场给你认榜。 ","#","^cid:st_ask_again_small","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^先收架，让他晒完这一面，自己在旁重走一遍，不急着求再一指。 ","#","^cid:st_try_after_stop","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_fish_question","re":true},"^我刚才脚还没走。 ","#","^beat:st_dry_fish_7 ","/#","#","^scene:st_oldyard ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_fishelder ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^手也还没走？ ","#","^beat:st_dry_fish_8 ","/#","#","^scene:st_oldyard ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_fishelder ","/#","#","^speaker:st_fishelder ","/#","#","^mood:st_fishelder=amused","/#","\n","^你低头看自己举起的那只手，老人已把另一面鱼翻过来。你得自己把刚才那一下再试，不是再问三遍他到底排第几。 ","#","^beat:st_dry_fish_9 ","/#","#","^scene:st_oldyard ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_fishelder ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"old_depth"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_fish_question","re":true},"^你才动，便想起刚才肩上那点先紧。老人没抬头替你判对错，只叫你往旁边半步，别挡太阳。 ","#","^beat:st_dry_fish_10 ","/#","#","^scene:st_oldyard ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_fishelder ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^好。 ","#","^beat:st_dry_fish_11 ","/#","#","^scene:st_oldyard ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_fishelder ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^你真的让开，没把自己的问武当整座院子都该先停的事。 ","#","^beat:st_dry_fish_12 ","/#","#","^scene:st_oldyard ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye,st_fishelder ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"old_depth"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"old_depth":[["^你不知晒鱼老人的确切境界，不能替他补一个返真的名字。海天门有些年代门主返真，院里仍有返真旧人；有衰时，最高层传承却少全断。前一代还在，下一代已接上，这才是门立得久的骨架。 ","#","^beat:st_old_depth_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_oldyard ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^出去还有你的差。别看见院后有老人，就当外头可以不接。 ","#","^beat:st_old_depth_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_oldyard ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=intent","/#","\n","^如今门主叶沧溟列总谱第三，也不能由此证明他便是全门最强。一个后来的弟子在楼下等你，问到这里，眼睛还等着一个比第三更响的数字。 ","#","^beat:st_old_depth_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_oldyard ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","ev","str","^直说不知道，把自己看见与没看见的都留清。 ","#","^cid:st_say_unknown","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^说明总谱第三是能核的名次，最强却不能替院里没出手的人答，再带后来人去接差。 ","#","^cid:st_point_next_work","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_last_unknown","re":true},"^不知道。 ","#","^beat:st_old_depth_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_oldyard ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^这句倒可以说得响一点。 ","#","^beat:st_old_depth_5 ","/#","#","^scene:st_oldyard ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:st_ye ","/#","#","^mood:st_ye=amused","/#","\n","^你笑着走出去，没有拿一个不知道再装出只有你才知道的秘密。 ","#","^beat:st_old_depth_6 ","/#","#","^scene:st_oldyard ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"last_look"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",false,"/ev",{"VAR=":"st_last_unknown","re":true},"^第三是现今总谱写的。是不是全门最强，我不知道。 ","#","^beat:st_old_depth_7 ","/#","#","^scene:st_oldyard ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^弟子还想问，你先让他看看下一班船是否已到；不是不许问，是不能为等一个漂亮答案便漏掉今天能做的事。 ","#","^beat:st_old_depth_8 ","/#","#","^scene:st_oldyard ","/#","#","^cast:st_ye ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":"last_look"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"last_look":["^望海楼门内，旧话每天都在：所见之海，非海之尽。十二岁的你曾以为楼最高，近三十以为九席最高；到六十三，走过九席门口，又见门后的日子仍有人在接。 ","#","^beat:st_last_look_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_tower ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator ","/#","#","^look:st_an=late","/#","\n","^新九席，今日还认得白螺屿来的船么？ ","#","^beat:st_last_look_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_tower ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:st_an ","/#","#","^mood:st_an=amused","/#","\n","^先看你这回哪只手来接绳。 ","#","^beat:st_last_look_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_tower ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n","^阿岑也老了，笑时仍先看泊位，不让回忆把别人的船挡在外头。 ","#","^beat:st_last_look_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_tower ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"st_exchange_drill"},"/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^早年一起换手练的习惯，他又教给后来人。有人解得比他慢，他等那一下，没因自己一直做得到便替旁人的手一把全做完。 ","#","^beat:st_last_look_5 ","/#","#","^scene:st_tower ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.64"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^旧腕阴天仍会酸，他不再拿伤替别人换一声勇敢。新人来接，他把那一扣教到对方真能解，再把绳松过去；你少赶那一班夜课，同他等到最后一轮试完。 ","#","^beat:st_last_look_6 ","/#","#","^scene:st_tower ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.64"},null]}],"nop","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"st_life"},1,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^今日你带新人回小船。船一晃，他先想钉住自己，你在旁边问下一步。远港的信到门里，你没亲去，先读给接了那趟的人听，再回头等学生自己从不稳里走出来。 ","#","^beat:st_last_look_7 ","/#","#","^scene:st_tower ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^这一回不把整条船都替他站了？ ","#","^beat:st_last_look_8 ","/#","#","^scene:st_tower ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:st_an ","/#","#","^mood:st_an=amused","/#","\n","^他得有地方走。 ","#","^beat:st_last_look_9 ","/#","#","^scene:st_tower ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.68"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^今日你随新人候潮。他问还要不要先记中原第几，你让他先认这一港谁接、下一港能问谁。岸上那班课已交给同门，你想回头看看，终究等船先把这一程走完。 ","#","^beat:st_last_look_10 ","/#","#","^scene:st_tower ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^回来别替他们把课也全重教一遍。 ","#","^beat:st_last_look_11 ","/#","#","^scene:st_tower ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:st_an ","/#","#","^mood:st_an=amused","/#","\n","^那回来先听他们讲。 ","#","^beat:st_last_look_12 ","/#","#","^scene:st_tower ","/#","#","^cast:st_an ","/#","#","^speaker:you","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.68"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"beyond_sea"},null],"beyond_sea":["^后来整理口述的人仍会问沈见潮，海天门到底有多高。他留下九招、七船与九船，也留下那句不知道。没有一个后来人需要先把海问完，才有资格把今天这一船接住。 ","#","^beat:st_beyond_sea_1 ","/#","#","^scene:st_horizon ","/#","#","^cast:none ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n","^楼外向东，仍有海。 ","#","^beat:st_beyond_sea_2 ","/#","#","^scene:st_horizon ","/#","#","^cast:none ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","\n",["ev",{"VAR?":"st_life"},1,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^你把船晃起来，让后来人自己迈下一步。没有人永远站稳，课却可以一直有人接。 ","#","^beat:st_beyond_sea_3 ","/#","#","^scene:st_horizon ","/#","#","^cast:none ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator ","/#","#","^ending:st_next_step","/#","\n","end",{"->":".^.^.^.30"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^下一港还没入眼，接班的人已经在船头。你不替他报一个海的尽头，只把能问下一句的地方指给他。 ","#","^beat:st_beyond_sea_4 ","/#","#","^scene:st_horizon ","/#","#","^cast:none ","/#","#","^speaker:narrator ","/#","#","^ending:st_next_watch","/#","\n","end",{"->":".^.^.^.30"},null]}],"nop","\n",null],"global decl":["ev",false,{"VAR=":"st_first_rail"},false,{"VAR=":"st_trial_breath"},false,{"VAR=":"st_shared_knot"},false,{"VAR=":"st_exchange_drill"},false,{"VAR=":"st_tide_follow"},false,{"VAR=":"st_transfer_line"},false,{"VAR=":"st_call_gap"},false,{"VAR=":"st_after_carry"},false,{"VAR=":"st_rush_plain"},false,{"VAR=":"st_rank_question"},false,{"VAR=":"st_flat_practice"},false,{"VAR=":"st_watch_space"},false,{"VAR=":"st_condition_excuse"},false,{"VAR=":"st_shared_post"},false,{"VAR=":"st_wait_paid"},false,{"VAR=":"st_listen_seat"},false,{"VAR=":"st_zhou_talk"},false,{"VAR=":"st_enter_plain"},false,{"VAR=":"st_fish_question"},false,{"VAR=":"st_last_unknown"},0,{"VAR=":"st_life"},"/ev","end",null]}],"listDefs":{}}